cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below. Always
  attribute the underlying sources (UNHCR, IDMC, UN WPP) and include the
  data snapshot id shown with each figure — see
  https://wheretheywent.lakkev.com/cite for responsible-citation guidance.
title: "Where They Went: a citable, multilingual platform for global forced-displacement statistics"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hsu
    given-names: Chih-Hua
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-5135-230X"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Lakkev/wheretheywent"
url: "https://wheretheywent.lakkev.com"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22087749
    description: >-
      Concept DOI for the quarterly-archived dataset — always resolves to
      the latest archived version; each quarter also has its own version DOI.
keywords:
  - refugees
  - forced displacement
  - internally displaced persons
  - statelessness
  - open data
  - UNHCR
  - IDMC
  - data visualization
